# unit_course_screen: the course screens' step and its state handlers,
# each as a call from its screen: CourseScreenStep (02:E356) for every
# mode's every state (those going on into code not filed yet as
# noreturn), the unlock (player 2 holding L and pressing Select:
# the seventh press, an earlier one, another button held, and the
# unlocked table); the handlers the tables jump to on the paths no run
# reaches: CourseScreenWindowStep, CourseScreenWipeOut and
# CourseScreenWipeIn at and before their ends, CoursePreviewRowsStunt and
# CoursePreviewRowsAll (pressed, done, counting, at the count's end),
# CoursePreviewReset, the state 0 starts, CourseScreenNothing,
# CourseScreenZoomOut and CourseScreenZoomIn (moving and at the end) and
# CourseRecordsDispatch (before the fade, then each panel state).
load build/stuntracefx/states/menus_course_grid_01.state
set 7E0D2B 00
set 7E0D40 00
set 7E0D24 00
call 02:E356 p=30 db=00 d=0000
